OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Austen to bring severe gales
OL,4,Ato UK as weather warning issued
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first named storm of the autumn -
OL,7,FStorm Austen - is set to batter parts
OL,8,Fof the UK with severe gales and heavy
OL,9,Frain beginning from Thursday night.
OL,11,FAhead of the storm, the Met Office has
OL,12,Fissued a yellow severe weather warning
OL,13,Ffor wind, which will come into force at
OL,14,Fmidnight Friday.
OL,16,FDamage to buildings and transport
OL,17,Fdisruption is likely, with the
OL,18,Fpossibility for power cuts.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
